Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.55,Kick,,0,0,0,,INDIA · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.55,Title,,0,0,0,,CYCLONE AKVAN\NNEARS THE COAST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.55,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: IMD forecast via OneIndia · The Federal\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}145 KM/H GUSTS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A very severe cyclone is about to hit Andhra Pradesh. Here is what the weather department expects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:15.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Extremely heavy rain, more than twenty one centimetres in a day, is forecast for north coastal Andhra on the nineteenth and twentieth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:17.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Who is affected?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:20.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Coastal Andhra Pradesh, south Odisha and Tamil Nadu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:26.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Fishermen have been asked not to go to sea, and Odisha has begun moving people from vulnerable areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.99,0:00:27.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Why it matters:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:30.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}this is the third cyclone in under a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:36.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Andhra Pradesh says two earlier storms have already caused losses of more than seven thousand crore rupees.
